   photos=["vrl-crew-wardrobe-taping","vrl-team-uniform","vrl-crew-stretch-wrap"],
   more=[("Rail Coach Factory transfers",
          ["Officers and staff of the Rail Coach Factory are posted between railway units across the country, so a move from Kapurthala can be a short hop to another Punjab town or a run of 2,000 km or more. The date to vacate the railway quarter decides everything. Give it to the coordinator at booking, and the packing is set a day earlier so there is time to clean the house and hand over the keys.",
           "Railway families usually build up years of goods: trunks, steel almirahs, a car and a scooter. Trunks are numbered on the inventory, vehicles are separate lines on the estimate, and the itemised GST invoice is set out for the transfer claim. Staff who need a bill accepted for IBA claims can book through our IBA-approved partner (code MUK-2068)."]),
         ("Who does the work in Kapurthala",
          ["We do not have an office, branch or own crew in Kapurthala. A verified partner team packs, loads and delivers, and one coordinator at our Sector 7, Panchkula head office stays reachable on your phone until the delivery is complete.",
           "Homes near the old palace area and the bazaar sit on narrow lanes where a large truck cannot turn. The partner team uses a smaller vehicle to bring goods out to the main road, and any extra carry is written into the estimate after the survey."])],
